56
00:02:30,534 --> 00:02:32,118
more expensive than the call you're buying.

57
00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:34,840
So you're collecting a credit on the call side,

58
00:02:34,940 --> 00:02:38,260
and then you are selling a put credit spread.

59
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:41,195
