62
00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:49,460
The combination of those two is what creates an Iron Condor.

63
00:02:49,580 --> 00:02:53,300
So it is two vertical spreads or two credit spreads.

64
00:02:53,620 --> 00:02:55,140
Credit spreads are also vertical spreads.

65
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:58,460
They're just the more technical name for what type of vertical spread you're trading.

66
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,640
